<!-- About -->
<section class="about section" id="about">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="about-content animate-on-scroll">
            <span class="section-label">About</span>
            <h2 class="section-title">Building software that works.</h2>
            <p>
                Over the past 14 years I've worked across the full spectrum of software engineering — from 
                designing and maintaining enterprise banking platforms that process over a million transactions 
                monthly, to architecting multi-tenant SaaS products from the ground up.
            </p>
            <p>
                My career began at Absa Bank, where I spent over a decade engineering mission-critical payment 
                systems, retail partner integrations and remote-sales platforms. I progressed from Specialist 
                Product Engineer to Lead Product Engineer (VP level), responsible for systems that maintained 
                99.9% availability and contributed to hundreds of millions in business value.
            </p>
            <p>
                In 2024 I founded <strong>Fakade Innovations (Pty) Ltd</strong>, the company behind the 
                <strong>M-Works™</strong> software platform — a suite of products I've designed and built to 
                solve real operational problems for businesses. From payroll orchestration to white-label 
                commerce platforms, M-Works represents my transition from enterprise engineering into 
                product ownership and entrepreneurship.
            </p>
            <p>
                I'm interested in distributed systems, cloud-native architecture, automation and the practical 
                application of AI in software engineering workflows. I build what businesses need, not what 
                tech trends tell them to.
            </p>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

